    "status": "present",
    "value": "Process operations left to right. [0,a,b] saves an a x b rectangle. [1,a,b] appends to the output whether every rectangle saved before it fits, independently and axis-aligned with optional 90-degree rotation, inside an a x b box (equal sides fit). With no saved rectangles the answer is true. Output has one boolean per query, in order."
  },
